rly a part  of that and getting testing right is  incredibly important  keeping there's a whole program of work  all the way through all and and we just  got it we work night and day on getting  on doing the very best we can on wor  them can I come on finish off I want to  ask you about the the the lockdown I  mean it's been well reported and some  experts have come forward and said look  it looks like the lockdown will have to  be extended we haven't had that definite  word yet  don't don't we need that as soon as  possible we need to be told rather than  having this this waiting period of three  or four days we need to be told now  don't we that this is going to be  extended through to the beginning of May  the only one thing that matters when it  comes to people making decisions about  how they get what they're going to do  this Easter weekend there's only one  thing that matters for that or all the  other discussion is important and I'm  quite happy to answer questions about it  there's only one thing that matters in  terms of what people do this weekend and  every single person can play their part  in the national effort to defeat this  virus by staying at home that's what I'm  doing and that's what everybody should  do Secretary of State good2talk team  thank you thank you

